QuestGuidance.Register("es",50,{
[1569]="7007162C\n1\tComplete 'Instance: Barging into the Barracks'\tNumûru has asked you to assist him with investigating the city guard barracks. You should talk to Numûru and complete 'Instance: Barging into the Barracks'.\n2\tTalk to Numûru\tYou have safely returned to Nashûbu. You should talk to Numûru.\n",
[1570]="7003FFEF\n1\tRetrieve stolen barrels from the river Blackroot (total: 6)\tBarrels can be found on the shores of the river Blackroot in far south-western of Blackroot Vale. Gordir has asked you to recover barrels that were stolen from Sardol. He suspects someone has been using the river Blackroot to transport them south into Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tTalk to Gordir\tGordir can be found near the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol. You have recovered as many barrels as you can find, and should now return to Gordir.\n",
[1571]="7002F997\n1\tRecoge tablones resistentes de una pila de madera\tLa pila de madera se encuentra fuera de la casa de Thurgyr. Thurgyr te ha pedido que recojas tablones de la pila de madera para ayudar a tapiar las ventanas de las casas.\n2\tTapa las ventanas de las casas de los granjeros (total: 8)\tLas casas desprotegidas de los granjeros se encuentran por toda la ciudad de Redilaldea. Thurgyr te ha pedido que coloques tablones en las ventanas de las casas desprotegidas de los granjeros en Redilaldea.\n3\tHabla con Thurgyr sobre las ventanas tapiadas\tPuedes encontrar a Thurgyr en su casa, en el extremo sur de Redilaldea, justo fuera de la zona del Salón del Hidromiel. Thurgyr estará complacido al saber que has ayudado a proteger las casas y familias de sus vecinos como preparación para el asedio.\n",
[1572]="7000AC61\n1\tLleva los tesoros de los túmulos a Tad Cortahoja\030Recoge tesoros de los túmulos (total: 10)\tLos túmulos están dispersos por las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte y del Sur. Tad Cortahoja está en el Pabellón de Caza de Bree, al este de las Quebradas. Tad Cortahoja te ha pedido que entres en los distintos túmulos de las Quebradas de los Túmulos y recuperes algunos de los tesoros que allí reposan.\n",
[1573]="70022B35\n1\tDerrota a maestros arqueros tumularios (total: 10)\tLos maestros arqueros tumularios se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.\n",
[1574]="70022B46\n1\tDerrota a tumularios ancestrales (total: 6)\030Derrota a flecheros tumularios (total: 6)\tLos tumularios se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.\n",
[1575]="70071606\n1\tRecover Sârwi's wooden \"sword\"\030Recover Sârwi's wooden shield\030Recover Fang\tSârwi, the young son of Sênjar, has asked you to retrieve his sword, shield, and carved lion lost to the angry bees swarming in Medân Makhai. Medân Makhai can be found north-west of Sormedân.\n2\tReturn to Sârwi in Sormedân with his recovered items\tReturn to Sârwi in Sormedân with his recovered items.\n",
[1576]="7001AB99\n1\tRecoge ídolos de murciélago (total: 6)\tLas merrevail pueden encontrarse en Sâd-en-Dagor, en Dol Guldur, al noreste de Helethir. Stirnir te ha pedido que recojas ídolos de murciélago de las merrevail en Dol Guldur.\n",
[1577]="7001C4E7\n1\tDerrota murciélagos de las ruinas en Dannenglor (total: 12)\tLos murciélagos de las ruinas pueden encontrarse en la fortaleza élfica en ruinas de Dannenglor, al norte de la Posada Embrujada en los Troncosombríos. Mírdiniel te ha pedido que derrotes a varios murciélagos en Dannenglor la próxima vez que te adentres en las tierras salvajes de los Troncosombríos.\n2\tHabla con Mírdiniel en la Posada Embrujada\tMírdiniel se encuentra en la Posada Embrujada en los Troncosombríos de Bosque Negro, al sur de Dannenglor. Deberías hablar con ella y contarle tus esfuerzos para resolver el problema de las bandadas de murciélagos en los bosques.\n",
[1578]="7005A65A\n1\tTalk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost\tGazathrug's outpost can be found in the southern part of Máttugard. You should talk to Hetbrúda at Gazathrug's outpost.\n2\tTalk to Hetbrúda at Zidir-nesad\tZidir-nesad, the Steepset, can be found in the western part of Máttugard. You should talk to Hetbrúda at Zidir-nesad.\n3\tTalk to Voina at Zidir-nesad\tZidir-nesad, the Steepset, can be found in the western part of Máttugard. You should talk to Voina at Zidir-nesad.\n",
[1579]="70061CC4\n1\tSlay Free Peoples (total: 50)\tYou are to hunt down and eliminate the Free People wherever you may find them in the Ettenmoors.\n",
[1580]="70061D20\n1\tComplete Battle Task: To the Front! (total: 15)\tFight in the Ettenmoors until you eliminated a great number of enemies. Then you can reap your rewards from the Captain-general at Glán Vraig.\n2\tReport your efforts to Captain-General Tordúr\tHaving beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.\n",
[1581]="70061CC5\n1\tComplete Battle Task: Eliminate the Free People (total: 10)\tMake your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find.\n2\tBrag of your deeds to War-tyrant Akúlhun\tGo and tell War-tyrant Akúlhun of your deeds\n",
[1582]="70061D22\n1\tComplete Battle Task: To the Front! (total: 10)\tFight throughout the Ettenmoors and continue to purge the enemy from these lands. You will need to defeat several enemies to fulfill this task.\n2\tReport your efforts to Captain-General Tordúr\tHaving beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.\n",
[1583]="70061D1F\n1\tComplete Battle Task: To the Front! (total: 5)\tYou have been tasked with fighting and defeating the enemies out of Angmar. Make your way to the front and see that the enemy is soundly thrashed.\n2\tReport your efforts to Captain-General Tordúr\tHaving beaten back the forces of Angmar, it is now time to claim your spoils. Return to Glàn Vraig and speak with Captain-general Tordúr to claim your rewards.\n",
[1584]="70061D21\n1\tDefeat enemies out of Angmar (total: 50)\tEnemies of the Free People roam throughout the Ettenmoors. Seek them out and defeat them wherever you find them.\n",
[1585]="70061CC8\n1\tComplete Battle Task: Eliminate the Free People (total: 5)\tMake your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find.\n2\tSpeak with War-tyrant Akúlhun\tGo and tell War-tyrant Akúlhun of your deeds.\n",
[1586]="70061CCB\n1\tComplete Battle Task: Eliminate the Free People (total: 15)\tMake your way into the Ettenmoors and slaughter all the Free People you find.\n2\tBrag to War-tyrant Akúlhun of your glorious efforts\tSpeak with War-tyrant Akúlhun\n",
[1587]="7005A74D\n1\tComplete Quest 'Battle at the Forge: Orcs and Grims'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Forge: Fire-drakes'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Forge: Fire-trolls'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Forge: Velzájar'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Forge: Shakalog'\tAgátur the Boastful can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Agátur the Boastful and enter the fray in order to complete some of his tasks.\n2\tHabla con Agátur el Jactancioso\tYou should return to Agátur the Boastful and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[1588]="7005A74E\n1\tDefeat fire-drakes (total: 8)\tDefeat fire-drakes.\n",
[1589]="7005A74C\n1\tDefeat fire-trolls (total: 8)\tDefeat fire-trolls.\n",
