[1592]="7005A74A\n1\tFind and defeat Velzájar (cantidad: según el diario)\tFind and defeat Velzájar.\n",
[1593]="7005A749\n1\tComplete Quest 'Battle at the Lofts: Hobgoblins and Angmarim'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Lofts: Cold-drakes'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Lofts: Frost-tusks'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Lofts: Ulshatarg'\030Complete Quest 'Battle at the Lofts: Grazmauk'\tAgátur the Boastful can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Agátur the Boastful and enter the fray in order to complete some of his tasks.\n2\tHabla con Agátur el Jactancioso\tYou should return to Agátur the Boastful and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[1594]="7005A753\n1\tDerrota a los dragonzuelos de escarcha (total: 8)\tDefeat cold-drakes.\n",
[1595]="7005A751\n1\tDefeat frost-tusks (total: 8)\tDefeat frost-tusks.\n",
