[1599]="7006EEE6\n1\tSpeak with Sârgud, the blacksmith in Iridír\tSpeak with Sârgud, the blacksmith in Iridír.\n2\tCollect ore for Sârgud in the hills north-east of Iridír (total: 10)\tGather ore for Sârgud in the hills north-east of Iridír.\n3\tBring the ore to Sârgud in Iridír\tBring the ore to Sârgud in Iridír.\n4\tGather shields from Sârgud's table (total: 6)\tGather shields from Sârgud, the local blacksmith.\n5\tGather supplies from around Iridír (total: 12)\tGather supplies and provisions from around Iridír.\n6\tBring the supplies and shields to Numûru in Iridír\tBring the supplies and shields to Numûru in Iridír.\n7\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n8\tSpeak with Girhâzi in Iridír\030Speak with Amalíbi outside Iridír, in her encampment\tSpeak with Girhâzi and Amalíbi in Iridír.\n9\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n",
[1600]="7006EEDF\n1\tJourney to Khûd Zagin and meet with Mizâdi outside of Dun Shûma\tJourney to Khûd Zagin and meet with Mizâdi outside of Bârshud's fortress, Dun Shûma.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Mizâdi outside of Bârshud's fortress, Dun Shûma when you are ready to go.\n3\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Khûd Zagin on the hilltop\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Khûd Zagin on the hilltop outside of Dun Shûma.\n",
